   "title": "上传未先同步v-model致校验报空",
   "type": "fact",
   "content": "`FileUpload` 上传成功先 `$emit('getList')` 后同步 `v-model`，使 `validateField` 时 `form.certificateFile` 为空而误报。于 `FileUpload/index.vue` 的 `handleUploadSuccess` 中先 `handleFileListChanged()` 同步 `v-model` 再 `$emit('getList')`，涉及 `staffManagement` 下两处 `certificatesDialog.vue`。",
   "evidence": "src=苏州市房地产监测V3/232.md",
